Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\org(0,0)\fscx0\fscy0\clip(0,0,0,0)}Your media player does not support the subtitle format used in this episode.\NSubtitles will likely not function properly.\NPlease use one of the recommended video players, preferably mpv:\Nhttps://mpv.io
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.92,0:01:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\org(0,0)\fscx0\fscy0\clip(0,0,0,0)}Your media player does not support the subtitle format used in this episode.\NSubtitles will likely not function properly.\NPlease use one of the recommended video players, preferably mpv:\Nhttps://mpv.io
Dialogue: 55,0:01:53.76,0:01:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro! What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 55,0:01:55.60,0:01:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{If I'm gonna be solidified,\NI prefer this pose. - OG}{I'll need to pose if I'm turning solid. - Z}Gotta pose before turning solid.{Z}
Dialogue: 55,0:01:57.47,0:01:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no time to be playing around!
Dialogue: 55,0:02:00.27,0:02:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{Anyway, do something about\Nyour leg! It's painful just looking at it! - OG}Anyway, do something\Nabout your legs!
Dialogue: 55,0:02:03.14,0:02:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{Anyway, do something about\Nyour leg! It's painful just looking at it! - OG}It hurts just looking at them!
Dialogue: 55,0:02:04.65,0:02:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Then quit looking at it.
Dialogue: 55,0:02:06.56,0:02:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{You're the idiot who suggested cutting our legs off in this situation - OG}Only an idiot would believe\Ncutting off his own legs
Dialogue: 55,0:02:10.44,0:02:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{so we could escape! - OG}is the best plan of escape!
Dialogue: 55,0:02:12.53,0:02:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{That ain't true! - OG}You've got it wrong!
Dialogue: 55,0:02:14.16,0:02:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I was gonna cut 'em off\Nso we could fight.
Dialogue: 55,0:02:16.37,0:02:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's even stupider! Get serious!
Dialogue: 55,0:02:19.45,0:02:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{Just shut up! - OG}Just give it a rest!
Dialogue: 55,0:02:21.29,0:02:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{Honestly! You have no\Ncommon sense! - OG}Honestly! This just goes to show\Nthat you have zero common sense!{Z}
Dialogue: 55,0:02:26.25,0:02:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{We still haven't even escaped\Nfrom this situation, - OG}We haven't even found\Na way out of this situation,
Dialogue: 55,0:02:30.38,0:02:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{yet neither of them seems to\Nsense the danger at all... - OG}yet both are oblivious\Nto their present danger.
Dialogue: 55,0:02:38.30,0:02:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{Hey, runt. Is that all\Nthe struggling you got? - OG}{Hey, kiddo. So you're\Njust going to sit back now? - Z}Hey, kiddo. Did you change\Nyour mind about fighting?{Z}
Dialogue: 55,0:02:41.89,0:02:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{Yeah. Looks like it's\Nsomeone else's turn now. - OG}Sure did.{Z}
Dialogue: 55,0:02:43.02,0:02:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{Yeah. Looks like it's\Nsomeone else's turn now. - OG}It's someone else's turn now.{Z}
Dialogue: 55,0:02:48.27,0:02:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{Mr. 3. Those people don't seem \Nconcerned at all. - OG}Mr. 3. They don't seem\Nconcerned at all.
Dialogue: 55,0:02:51.94,0:02:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I could say the same about you,\NMiss Golden Week!
Dialogue: 55,0:02:56.20,0:02:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Urgh!
Dialogue: 55,0:02:59.37,0:03:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{Hey. If you're gonna do a pose,\Nnow's your chance. - OG}Hey, now's the chance\Nfor your own cool pose.
Dialogue: 55,0:03:01.58,0:03:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{Mr. Bushido! Please be\Nmore serious about this! - OG}Mr. Bushido! Please take this\Na bit more seriously.
Dialogue: 55,0:03:04.96,0:03:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm always serious.
Dialogue: 55,0:03:06.54,0:03:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{More like stupid. - OG}You mean always stupid!
Dialogue: 55,0:03:08.50,0:03:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Like you have any room to talk!
Dialogue: 55,0:03:08.88,0:03:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{It seems we're being mocked. - OG}It's as if they're mocking us.
Dialogue: 55,0:03:12.63,0:03:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{This is truly displeasing! - OG}This is most irksome!
Dialogue: 55,0:03:16.05,0:03:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 55,0:03:18.05,0:03:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{He hardly seems to be\Nthat reliable of a man. - OG}This man doesn't seem\Nto pose any danger.
Dialogue: 55,0:03:22.39,0:03:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. 3!
Dialogue: 55,0:03:24.48,0:03:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll finish him off.
Dialogue: 55,0:03:27.15,0:03:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Finish him off?
Dialogue: 55,0:03:29.44,0:03:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{Don't be silly. - OG}Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 55,0:03:31.52,0:03:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look!
Dialogue: 55,0:03:33.07,0:03:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{He showed up here alive and well\Nbecause your attacks don't work. - OG}Your attacks didn't even faze him,\Nand now he's here, alive and well.
Dialogue: 55,0:03:38.36,0:03:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{At the very least, he's at a level\Nthat's too much for you to handle. - OG}Evidently, he's a bit more\Nthan you two could handle.
Dialogue: 55,0:03:45.00,0:03:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{You two can take care of the others! - OG}I'll leave the rest of the rabble to you!
Dialogue: 55,0:03:48.96,0:03:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{I think I'll add Straw Hat Luffy\Nto my wax figure collection... - OG}As for Straw Hat Luffy, I'll add him\Nto my collection of wax figures.
Dialogue: 55,0:03:56.84,0:03:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are too damn annoying!
Dialogue: 55,0:04:00.85,0:04:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{You've gone a bit too far!\NGive yourselves up! - OG}You've crossed the line!
Dialogue: 55,0:04:02.89,0:04:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{You've gone a bit too far!\NGive yourselves up! - OG}Time to eat dirt!
Dialogue: 55,0:04:09.27,0:04:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright! Preparations are complete!
Dialogue: 55,0:04:11.40,0:04:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We got your back, Luffy!
Dialogue: 55,0:04:14.19,0:04:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Did you say something?
Dialogue: 55,0:04:16.40,0:04:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're mine!
Dialogue: 55,0:04:18.28,0:04:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Candle Lock!
Dialogue: 55,0:04:24.99,0:04:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What is {\i1}that{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 55,0:04:28.58,0:04:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{Luffy-[/i1]san[/i0]! - OG}Luffy!
Dialogue: 55,0:04:29.62,0:04:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{Damn. He's already gotten caught?! - OG}Damn, he got caught already?!{Z}
Dialogue: 55,0:04:31.79,0:04:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{Idiot! - OG}Bonehead!
Dialogue: 55,0:04:34.09,0:04:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this? It's heavy, like a mallet!
Dialogue: 55,0:04:37.67,0:04:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{How simple. - OG}Piece of cake.
Dialogue: 55,0:04:40.72,0:04:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Now for your hands!
Dialogue: 55,0:04:46.43,0:04:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! This is perfect!
Dialogue: 55,0:04:48.64,0:04:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Candle Lock!
Dialogue: 55,0:04:59.07,0:05:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Old giant guy!
Dialogue: 55,0:05:01.70,0:05:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to bother you!
Dialogue: 55,0:05:03.95,0:05:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! What's he up to?!
Dialogue: 55,0:05:16.71,0:05:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 55,0:05:19.42,0:05:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Mallet!
Dialogue: 55,0:05:25.22,0:05:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,– He did it!\N– He did it!
Dialogue: 55,0:05:44.74,0:05:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{Lucky! The mallet on my legs broke, too! - OG}Luckily, the mallet\Non my legs broke too!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:47.99,0:05:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha...?
Dialogue: 55,0:05:51.37,0:05:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 55,0:05:52.79,0:05:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 55,0:05:57.55,0:05:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{I'm alive... - OG}Still alive...
Dialogue: 55,0:06:00.88,0:06:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We survived...
Dialogue: 55,0:06:02.84,0:06:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{That didn't help things at all! - OG}Our situation hasn't changed at all!
Dialogue: 55,0:06:06.30,0:06:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{Whew, that was dangerous!\NWhy didn't you guys run? - OG}That was dangerous!\NWhy didn't you guys run away?
Dialogue: 55,0:06:09.43,0:06:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,– We can't move! Isn't it obvious?!\N– We can't move! Isn't it obvious?!
Dialogue: 55,0:06:12.56,0:06:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{Oh? Really? - OG}Oh, for real?
Dialogue: 55,0:06:14.73,0:06:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But you guys told me\Nto break the pillar!
Dialogue: 55,0:06:17.65,0:06:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{Is it really a good idea to put our\Nlives in his hands, Mr. Bushido?! - OG}Mr. Bushido, why exactly are we\Nputting our lives in his hands?!
Dialogue: 55,0:06:22.15,0:06:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{Don't look at me.\NThat's the only choice we got here. - OG}{Why? That's the\Nonly choice left to us. - Z}Well, we don't have\Na choice in the matter.{Z}
Dialogue: 55,0:06:25.28,0:06:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus it looks like\Nmy arms are stuck now.
Dialogue: 55,0:06:31.54,0:06:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on..
Dialogue: 55,0:06:33.04,0:06:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,647)}{Hold on... It feels like my body\Nis hardening more and more now... - OG}It feels like my body is solidifying\Nmore and more now.
Dialogue: 55,0:06:37.63,0:06:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{I can't move at all now... - OG}I can't... move... anymore.
Dialogue: 55,0:06:48.26,0:06:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{Fools! - OG}You fools!
Dialogue: 55,0:06:49.76,0:06:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{With the candles closer,\Nyour hardening has sped up! - OG}With the candles closer to you,\Nyou'll harden that much quicker!
Dialogue: 55,0:06:54.10,0:06:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{Now you can become\Nwax figures even quicker! - OG}Now you will become\Nmy human wax candles posthaste!
Dialogue: 55,0:06:59.98,0:07:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{That guy thinks he can act\Nall smug and arrogant! - OG}Who does that\Narrogant bastard think he is?!
Dialogue: 55,0:07:05.32,0:07:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! You guys are\Ngonna be wax figures?
Dialogue: 55,0:07:07.99,0:07:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what we've\Nbeen trying to tell you!
Dialogue: 55,0:07:10.24,0:07:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{Just destroy this set, Luffy-[/i1]san[/i0]! - OG}Just destroy this set, Luffy!
Dialogue: 55,0:07:13.16,0:07:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{Right! Okay! - OG}Alright, I'm on it!{Z}
Dialogue: 55,0:07:15.12,0:07:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{I told you, I won't let you interfere! - OG}How dare you get in the way!{Z- see line at 08:48 and 08:49}
Dialogue: 55,0:07:18.42,0:07:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Wax-Wax Arts: Harpoon!
Dialogue: 55,0:07:20.50,0:07:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Exploding Star!
Dialogue: 55,0:07:44.90,0:07:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{That was rather bland.\NYou don't use very good gunpowder. - OG}Pretty bland.
Dialogue: 55,0:07:47.03,0:07:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{That was rather bland.\NYou don't use very good gunpowder. - OG}You don't use\Nhigh-quality gunpowder.
Dialogue: 55,0:07:49.03,0:07:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{He ate the exploding star! - OG}He ate... my exploding star?!
Dialogue: 55,0:07:56.46,0:07:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 55,0:07:59.21,0:08:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It really {\i1}is{\i0} fast.
Dialogue: 55,0:08:00.84,0:08:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Good thing I posed beforehand.
Dialogue: 55,0:08:02.96,0:08:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{You idiot! - OG}Moron!
Dialogue: 55,0:08:03.67,0:08:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{Luffy-[/i1]san[/i0]! Please, hurry! - OG}Luffy, please hurry!
Dialogue: 55,0:08:08.18,0:08:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{Alright! That pumpkin's\Nthe bad thing, right?! - OG}Alright! That pumpkin's\Nthe problem, right?!
Dialogue: 55,0:08:11.10,0:08:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 55,0:08:12.01,0:08:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 55,0:08:12.76,0:08:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use!
Dialogue: 55,0:08:14.72,0:08:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Candle Wall!
Dialogue: 55,0:08:17.64,0:08:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Bazooka!
Dialogue: 55,0:08:23.52,0:08:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{Hey, you! Don't get in my way! - OG}Hey! Outta the way!{Z- see line at 07:43}
Dialogue: 55,0:08:25.07,0:08:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{That would be[/i1]my[/i0]line. - OG}I believe I just told you\Nthe same thing.{Z- see line at 07:43}
Dialogue: 55,0:08:27.95,0:08:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd appreciate it if you didn't\Ninterfere with my creative activities.
Dialogue: 55,0:08:32.37,0:08:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Candle Lock!
Dialogue: 55,0:08:36.95,0:08:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a mallet!
Dialogue: 55,0:08:39.50,0:08:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 55,0:08:41.33,0:08:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{Oh no! - OG}Drat!
Dialogue: 55,0:08:42.46,0:08:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Candle Wall!
Dialogue: 55,0:08:43.71,0:08:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}...Mallet!
Dialogue: 55,0:09:03.15,0:09:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hooray! Hooray!
Dialogue: 55,0:09:04.15,0:09:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,M-Mr. 3...!
Dialogue: 55,0:09:05.52,0:09:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 55,0:09:08.11,0:09:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, hurry and break this set\Nwhile there's still time!
Dialogue: 55,0:09:12.03,0:09:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 55,0:09:12.95,0:09:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit joking around and hurry!
Dialogue: 55,0:09:15.91,0:09:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 55,0:09:17.29,0:09:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{This is no time to be acting stupid! - OG}This isn't the time for your antics!
Dialogue: 55,0:09:19.12,0:09:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{Luffy-[/i1]san[/i0]! Please! - OG}Luffy, please!
Dialogue: 55,0:09:22.96,0:09:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{What should I do? - OG}What... do I do?{Z}
Dialogue: 55,0:09:25.17,0:09:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{I don't feel like saving you guys. - OG}I don't wanna save you guys.
Dialogue: 55,0:09:31.43,0:09:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 55,0:09:35.55,0:09:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Colors Trap.
Dialogue: 55,0:09:39.02,0:09:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Luffy!
Dialogue: 55,0:09:40.64,0:09:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time! Do something\Nabout this thing already!
Dialogue: 55,0:09:43.90,0:09:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah... I know.
Dialogue: 55,0:09:45.52,0:09:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{Then hurry if you know! - OG}If you know, then hurry!
Dialogue: 55,0:09:47.44,0:09:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{Yeah, Luffy! - OG}Come on, Luffy!
Dialogue: 55,0:09:49.61,0:09:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, but...
Dialogue: 55,0:09:51.49,0:09:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{But I don't feel like saving you... - OG}But I don't wanna save you.
Dialogue: 55,0:09:54.37,0:09:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{Why do you keep saying that?! - OG}Yeah, you keep saying that!
Dialogue: 55,0:09:56.62,0:09:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{We're the ones who're\Nabout to be wax figures! - OG}Meanwhile, we're almost wax figures!
Dialogue: 55,0:09:58.62,0:10:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Understand?! We're about to die!
Dialogue: 55,0:10:00.83,0:10:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 55,0:10:01.96,0:10:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{But for some reason,\NI just can't get motivated. - OG}But for some reason,\NI just don't care anymore.
Dialogue: 55,0:10:05.08,0:10:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{– This isn't a motivation problem!\N– This isn't a motivation problem! - OG}{– It's not[/i1]about[/i0]whether you care!\N– It's not[/i1]about[/i0]whether you care! - Z}– We need you to {\i1}start{\i0} caring!\N– We need you to {\i1}start{\i0} caring!{Z}
Dialogue: 55,0:10:09.80,0:10:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 55,0:10:11.47,0:10:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{What's happened to him?! - OG}What the hell's {\i1}with{\i0} him?!
Dialogue: 55,0:10:13.76,0:10:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{Our friends're gonna die\Nif he doesn't hurry! - OG}If he doesn't get moving,\Nour friends are gonna die!
Dialogue: 55,0:10:19.14,0:10:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{I'll bring him back to his senses! - OG}I'll bring him to his senses!
Dialogue: 55,0:10:21.06,0:10:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Karoo!
Dialogue: 55,0:10:25.44,0:10:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-When did you...?!
Dialogue: 55,0:10:28.52,0:10:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it up.
Dialogue: 55,0:10:29.90,0:10:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He's already fallen into a trap.
Dialogue: 55,0:10:31.86,0:10:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 55,0:10:33.11,0:10:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,See where he's standing?
Dialogue: 55,0:10:34.82,0:10:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Where he's standing?
Dialogue: 55,0:10:39.41,0:10:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 55,0:10:40.74,0:10:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{There's a strange black pattern... - OG}There's a strange black symbol.
Dialogue: 55,0:10:43.58,0:10:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What's so important about that?!
Dialogue: 55,0:10:46.04,0:10:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right. It's nothing.\NIt's just paint.
Dialogue: 55,0:10:51.63,0:10:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Paint?
Dialogue: 55,0:10:53.51,0:11:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{In other words,\Nboth you and them are goners! - OG}To sum it up, it symbolizes the end\Nfor both you... {\i1}and{\i0} your friends!
Dialogue: 55,0:11:14.99,0:11:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Karoo! Let's just run for now!
Dialogue: 55,0:11:18.82,0:11:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{He's planning to escape on the bird! - OG}They're flying the coop!
Dialogue: 55,0:11:20.83,0:11:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get 'em.
Dialogue: 55,0:11:26.58,0:11:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{Sprint at full speed! - OG}Full speed ahead!
Dialogue: 55,0:11:32.59,0:11:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you! W-Wait!\NI haven't gotten on yet! Karoo!
Dialogue: 55,0:11:39.51,0:11:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{Alright! Hey! Stop! Let me get on! - OG}Alright! Hey! Stop! Lemme on!
Dialogue: 55,0:11:47.98,0:11:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{What's the point in being scared of me?! - OG}Why the hell are you afraid of {\i1}me{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 55,0:11:57.95,0:11:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Golden Week!
Dialogue: 55,0:12:00.24,0:12:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your doing!
Dialogue: 55,0:12:02.74,0:12:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Colors Trap: Betrayal Black.
Dialogue: 55,0:12:07.25,0:12:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Touch the black paint,
Dialogue: 55,0:12:09.08,0:12:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and you'll want to betray your friends,\Nno matter what they say.
Dialogue: 55,0:12:13.92,0:12:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What does she mean?!
Dialogue: 55,0:12:15.30,0:12:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{What happened?! Explain! - OG}Tell us what happened!
Dialogue: 55,0:12:17.42,0:12:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{She's a "realist painter" who can\Neven create real colors of emotion! - OG}That girl is a realist painter who can\Nrecreate the colors of emotion.
Dialogue: 55,0:12:21.64,0:12:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha...?
Dialogue: 55,0:12:23.89,0:12:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{Her refined sense of color\Ncan manipulate people's minds - OG}Her refined sense of color\Ncan be used to manipulate
Dialogue: 55,0:12:27.89,0:12:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{through the use of her paints. - OG}those who interact with her paints.
Dialogue: 55,0:12:30.60,0:12:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Manipulate?! That's not good!
Dialogue: 55,0:12:34.15,0:12:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That simpleminded idiot is\Nalready easy enough to manipulate!
Dialogue: 55,0:12:39.70,0:12:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{Then doesn't he just need\Nto get away from that paint? - OG}Then... can't he just\Nstep off the paint?
Dialogue: 55,0:12:42.99,0:12:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Get away from there!
Dialogue: 55,0:12:45.45,0:12:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't!
Dialogue: 55,0:12:46.58,0:12:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{Luffy-[/i1]san[/i0]! - OG}Luffy!
Dialogue: 55,0:12:47.45,0:12:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you do,\Ndo {\i1}not{\i0} move from that black circle!
Dialogue: 55,0:12:51.42,0:12:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 55,0:12:55.00,0:12:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Vivi! Why?!
Dialogue: 55,0:12:56.38,0:12:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{We don't want you to save us at all! - OG}We absolutely do not\Nwant you to save us!
Dialogue: 55,0:13:01.64,0:13:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 55,0:13:04.01,0:13:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{I get it. - OG}I see now.
Dialogue: 55,0:13:05.93,0:13:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{You made him do the exact\Nopposite of what you said... - OG}He's being made to do\Nthe exact opposite of what he's told.
Dialogue: 55,0:13:10.06,0:13:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 55,0:13:12.56,0:13:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{I-I was kind of weird just now! - OG}Th-That was a bit weird just now.
Dialogue: 55,0:13:15.90,0:13:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{Alright! I'll save you right now! - OG}Alright! Time to save you!
Dialogue: 55,0:13:25.74,0:13:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{But never mind you guys!\NI just wanna laugh! - OG}Aw, forget it, you guys!\NGotta laugh!
Dialogue: 53,0:13:30.83,0:13:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(1172,27)}Why?!
Dialogue: 52,0:13:31.87,0:13:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{Why, you...! - OG}You little...!
Dialogue: 51,0:13:32.88,0:13:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(274,27)}{\i1}Now{\i0} what?!
Dialogue: 55,0:13:39.67,0:13:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Colors Trap: Laughter Yellow.
Dialogue: 55,0:13:43.09,0:13:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{You know you're not supposed to move. - OG}Hey now. Stay still.
Dialogue: 55,0:13:47.26,0:13:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{Now it's on his clothes! - OG}It's on his clothes!
Dialogue: 55,0:13:49.39,0:13:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{Luffy! Hurry and take off that clothing! - OG}Luffy! Hurry and take off that vest!
Dialogue: 55,0:13:51.98,0:13:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,N-Never mind that!
Dialogue: 55,0:13:54.48,0:13:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{I just feel like laughing right now! - OG}I just wanna laugh right now!
Dialogue: 55,0:14:00.82,0:14:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{Not good...! - OG}Son of a...!
Dialogue: 55,0:14:02.78,0:14:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{If it keeps raining down at this pace,\Nwe won't last one more minute! - OG}At the pace it's raining down,\Nwe won't last another minute!
Dialogue: 55,0:14:14.12,0:14:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{Did you guys come here to play?! - OG}Did you guys only come to fool around?!
Dialogue: 55,0:14:20.67,0:14:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! When Usopp ran into him,\Nthe paint on his back smudged!
Dialogue: 55,0:14:27.47,0:14:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{Did I wind up doing something again? - OG - OG}Did she make me\Ndo something again?{Z}
Dialogue: 55,0:14:33.14,0:14:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you! Knock it off, you jerk!
Dialogue: 55,0:14:36.36,0:14:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{Was Laughter Yellow funny? - OG}Was my Laughter Yellow a riot?
Dialogue: 55,0:14:39.19,0:14:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{Shut up! Are you stupid?! Stupid! - OG}Shut up! Are you nuts?\NThat's just dumb!
Dialogue: 55,0:14:43.03,0:14:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I gotta break that pumpkin!
Dialogue: 55,0:14:45.49,0:14:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 55,0:14:47.62,0:14:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,350)}Colors Trap: Bullfight Red.
Dialogue: 55,0:14:51.79,0:14:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Bazooka!
Dialogue: 55,0:14:54.75,0:14:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you aiming?!
Dialogue: 55,0:14:56.38,0:14:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not allowed to break it!
Dialogue: 55,0:14:58.04,0:14:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll make Mr. 3 angry!
Dialogue: 55,0:14:59.84,0:15:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{What is this?! - OG}What the hell?!
Dialogue: 55,0:15:01.55,0:15:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{Just as bulls rush at red capes, - OG}The same way bulls\Nneed to charge at red capes,
Dialogue: 55,0:15:05.43,0:15:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{you feel the urge to attack\Nthat Bullfight Red mark. - OG}you now can't help but attack\Nmy bullfight red mark.
Dialogue: 55,0:15:08.30,0:15:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 55,0:15:10.68,0:15:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{I can't stand you anymore!\NGet out of here! - OG}You suck! I'm gonna send you flying!
Dialogue: 55,0:15:14.31,0:15:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum Bazooka!
Dialogue: 55,0:15:19.40,0:15:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Having fun?
Dialogue: 55,0:15:22.32,0:15:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no good.
Dialogue: 55,0:15:23.61,0:15:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't his kind of fight.
Dialogue: 55,0:15:26.24,0:15:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{All his power is useless! - OG}His powers are useless here!
Dialogue: 55,0:15:28.32,0:15:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{Now to finish it with this! - OG}Here's the finishing touch!
Dialogue: 55,0:15:29.66,0:15:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll mix the Laughter Yellow\Non your back with Sadness Blue!
Dialogue: 55,0:15:34.83,0:15:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Colors Trap: Tranquil Green!
Dialogue: 55,0:15:42.67,0:15:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{Such nice tea... - OG}This tea is tasty.
Dialogue: 55,0:15:45.05,0:15:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{– You idiot!\N– You idiot! - OG}– You moron!\N– You moron!{Z}
Dialogue: 55,0:15:47.80,0:15:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{So... What happens now? - OG}So, now what?
Dialogue: 55,0:15:50.05,0:15:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{See? I told you you should've posed! - OG}See? You should've posed\Nlike I told you.{Z}
Dialogue: 55,0:15:53.56,0:15:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{Too bad for you! - OG}Too late for that.
Dialogue: 55,0:15:55.31,0:15:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{How can you still be so calm about this?! - OG}How are you still so calm?!
Dialogue: 55,0:16:08.99,0:16:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, they run away fast!
Dialogue: 55,0:16:16.33,0:16:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Nose Fancy Double Cannon!
Dialogue: 55,0:16:23.84,0:16:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You missed!
Dialogue: 55,0:16:25.21,0:16:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Karoo!
Dialogue: 55,0:16:30.30,0:16:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My turn!
Dialogue: 55,0:16:31.30,0:16:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Lethal Lead Star!
Dialogue: 55,0:16:36.35,0:16:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{We gotta go back to Luffy\Nand the others again! - OG}We gotta return\Nto Luffy and the others!
Dialogue: 55,0:16:41.31,0:16:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{We're getting nowhere,\Nchasing them all around. - OG}All this running around is pointless.
Dialogue: 55,0:16:43.94,0:16:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{Yeah. - OG}No kidding!
Dialogue: 55,0:16:50.16,0:16:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{I didn't want to use it\Non such small fries, - OG}I didn't want to use it\Non such a small-timer,
Dialogue: 55,0:16:52.87,0:16:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,but there's no dodging this.
Dialogue: 55,0:16:55.74,0:17:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,A .44-caliber,\Nsix-shot, flintlock revolver.
Dialogue: 55,0:17:00.83,0:17:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{A new South Blue model. - OG}A new model from the South Blue.
Dialogue: 55,0:17:03.71,0:17:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{It can fire continuously, and if I use it, the bullets are invisible. - OG}It's rapid-fire, and when I use it,\Nno one will see it coming.
Dialogue: 55,0:17:10.68,0:17:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{Luffy's acting that way because of that paint the bad guys mentioned! - OG}Luffy's all weird because of the paint\Nthe bad guys mentioned!
Dialogue: 55,0:17:16.14,0:17:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They're related somehow!
Dialogue: 55,0:17:18.10,0:17:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{There was also some on his back\Nwhen I crashed into him earlier! - OG}He also had some on his back\Nwhen I crashed into him earlier!
Dialogue: 55,0:17:22.52,0:17:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{No doubt about it! - OG}That's the plan!
Dialogue: 55,0:17:24.02,0:17:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{If I can just do something\Nabout the paint...! - OG}I gotta take care of that paint!
Dialogue: 55,0:17:26.44,0:17:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 55,0:17:45.29,0:17:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{Such nice tea... - OG}Such lovely tea.
Dialogue: 55,0:17:48.09,0:17:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 55,0:17:50.05,0:17:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy! What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 55,0:17:55.26,0:18:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{Such... nice... tea... - OG}Such... lovely... tea...
Dialogue: 55,0:18:01.69,0:18:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{What are you doing, you idiot?! - OG}What are you doing, you dumbass?!
Dialogue: 55,0:18:09.23,0:18:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{It's over for all of you. - OG}It's all over for you.
Dialogue: 55,0:18:11.45,0:18:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{This is my ultimate ability! - OG}This ability is second to none.
Dialogue: 55,0:18:14.49,0:18:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Lethal Fire Star!
Dialogue: 55,0:18:27.96,0:18:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{What an idiot! He missed his\Ntarget and hit his own friend! - OG}How incompetent! He missed\Nhis target and hit his friend!{Z}
Dialogue: 55,0:18:33.26,0:18:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{Where'd his bullets go?! - OG}Aren't there supposed to be bullets?!
Dialogue: 55,0:18:39.22,0:18:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Breeze Breath Bomb!
Dialogue: 55,0:18:46.10,0:18:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{I forgot to mention it,\Nbut my breath explodes. - OG}Oh yeah, my breath is explosive too.
Dialogue: 55,0:18:50.57,0:18:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit...!
Dialogue: 55,0:18:52.74,0:18:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{This is insane!\NHe had no bullets?! - OG}This is insane!\NHe never even had bullets?!
Dialogue: 55,0:18:56.07,0:18:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{Karoo! You alright?! - OG}Karoo! You okay?!
Dialogue: 55,0:19:00.08,0:19:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{Hey! You come to your senses?! - OG}Hey! Have you come to your senses?!
Dialogue: 55,0:19:02.33,0:19:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 55,0:19:03.62,0:19:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{I'm awake! Thanks! - OG}I'm myself now, thanks!{Z}
Dialogue: 55,0:19:07.17,0:19:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{That attack was meant to burn his clothes and the Trap on it to undo the mental manipulation! - OG}{\q2}That attack burned his vest and the trap,\Nundoing the mental manipulation!{Z}
Dialogue: 55,0:19:12.84,0:19:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of that paint!
Dialogue: 55,0:19:18.30,0:19:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{I refuse to let anyone else die! - OG}I won't let you kill anyone else!
Dialogue: 55,0:19:22.31,0:19:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm mad!
Dialogue: 55,0:19:26.23,0:19:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{It's definitely weird. Damn weird. - OG}Something's not right.\NDefinitely not right.
Dialogue: 55,0:19:29.52,0:19:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{Why hasn't anyone come back\Nafter all this time? - OG}It's been a long time,\Nbut everyone's still gone.
Dialogue: 55,0:19:33.24,0:19:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{Something must've happened\Nto Nami-[/i1]san[/i0], Vivi-[/i1]chan[/i0], and the rest. - OG}Something must've happened\Nto Nami, Vivi, and the rest.
Dialogue: 55,0:19:36.70,0:19:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{In which case, this is no time to\Nbe getting ready to cook a lizard! - OG}If so, now's not the time to be\Ncooking up this lizard.
Dialogue: 55,0:19:42.74,0:19:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{N-wami-[/i1]san[/i0]! Vivi-[/i1]chwan[/i0]! - OG}Nami my sweet! Vivi my love!{Z}
Dialogue: 55,0:19:44.75,0:19:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{N-wami-[/i1]san[/i0]! Vivi-[/i1]chwan[/i0]! - OG}Nami my sweet! Vivi my love!{Z}
Dialogue: 55,0:19:48.25,0:19:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{Hey! Say something! - OG}Hey! You out there?!
Dialogue: 55,0:19:51.13,0:19:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you!
Dialogue: 55,0:19:58.51,0:20:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 55,0:20:03.14,0:20:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{So what if you're mad? - OG}Who cares if you're mad?
Dialogue: 55,0:20:05.31,0:20:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at your friends now!
Dialogue: 55,0:20:07.64,0:20:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{So what?! They're still alive! - OG}What's your point?! They're still alive!
Dialogue: 55,0:20:12.48,0:20:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{Are they, now? - OG}You sure 'bout that?
Dialogue: 55,0:20:14.36,0:20:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{All they need now is some\Nof Miss Golden Week's paint - OG}When Miss Golden Week\Nfinishes painting them,
Dialogue: 55,0:20:17.82,0:20:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{and they'll be exceptional wax figures! - OG}they'll be exceptional wax figures!
Dialogue: 55,0:20:20.24,0:20:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too late, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 55,0:20:24.04,0:20:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's correct!
Dialogue: 55,0:20:26.91,0:20:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{You're not only late, but now you\Ncan experience even more despair! - OG}Your time is up, and now you will\Ntaste the bitterness of despair!
Dialogue: 55,0:20:41.60,0:20:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{Move out! - OG}Deploy!
Dialogue: 55,0:20:49.48,0:20:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Candle...
Dialogue: 55,0:20:53.57,0:20:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Champion!
Dialogue: 55,0:21:01.32,0:21:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 55,0:21:03.03,0:21:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{It's said he once took down a 42\Nmillion berry bounty with this. - OG}They say he took down someone\Nworth 42 million berries with that thing.
Dialogue: 55,0:21:08.50,0:21:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{It's Mr. 3's ultimate artistic talent. - OG}It's Mr. 3's artistic masterpiece!
Dialogue: 55,0:21:11.00,0:21:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{Now come, Miss Golden Week!\NPerform an artistic paint job on me! - OG}Come, Miss Golden Week!
Dialogue: 55,0:21:13.50,0:21:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Paint me using your artistry.
Dialogue: 55,0:21:17.80,0:21:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I take a break after that?
Dialogue: 55,0:21:19.72,0:21:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course!
Dialogue: 55,0:21:21.22,0:21:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{I'd actually\Nprefer you to stay out of this! - OG}I'd actually prefer\Nyou stay out of this!
Dialogue: 55,0:21:23.76,0:21:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this, I am invincible!
Dialogue: 55,0:21:27.18,0:21:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{This armor is as hard as steel and wrapped around me like velvet! - OG}{This armor is as hard as steel, and it's enveloped me like velvet! - Z}The wax armor encasing me is\Nhard as steel, yet so flexible!{Gaijin}
Dialogue: 55,0:21:33.06,0:21:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,My form now...
Dialogue: 55,0:21:36.86,0:21:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{has no flaws! - OG}has no weak point!
Dialogue: 55,0:21:42.45,0:21:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,S-So cool!
Dialogue: 55,0:21:45.28,0:21:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no time to be\Nadmiring him! Fight!
Dialogue: 55,0:21:52.67,0:21:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 55,0:21:54.46,0:21:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 55,0:21:57.09,0:21:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Paint job complete!
Dialogue: 55,0:21:58.30,0:21:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, then!
Dialogue: 55,0:21:59.34,0:22:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}...Pistol!
Dialogue: 55,0:22:03.34,0:22:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Champ Fight: Field Combine!
Dialogue: 55,0:22:09.02,0:22:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 55,0:22:12.52,0:22:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Stamp!
Dialogue: 55,0:22:19.48,0:22:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use!
Dialogue: 55,0:22:20.53,0:22:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{Not good! The guy's so solid\Nhis attacks don't work! - OG}Not good! Luffy's attacks\Nwon't work on something so solid!
Dialogue: 55,0:22:29.79,0:22:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{Damn! The wax haze! - OG}Damn! The wax mist!
Dialogue: 55,0:22:34.50,0:22:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Wax?
Dialogue: 55,0:22:38.92,0:22:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 55,0:22:40.63,0:22:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{Why didn't I realize it sooner?! - OG}Why didn't I see it sooner?!
Dialogue: 55,0:22:43.51,0:22:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{The fact it turns into\Na mist means it can melt! - OG}Just the fact that it can mist\Nmeans it can melt!
Dialogue: 55,0:22:48.14,0:22:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Fire melts this guy's wax!
Dialogue: 55,0:22:50.77,0:22:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how hard it is,\Nwax is still wax!
Dialogue: 55,0:22:53.10,0:22:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro, Master Brogy, and all the others\Nhardened only moments ago!
Dialogue: 55,0:22:56.86,0:22:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We can save them!
Dialogue: 55,0:22:58.98,0:23:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{What?! For reals?! - OG}What?! For real?!
Dialogue: 55,0:23:00.73,0:23:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{Yeah, for reals. - OG}Yeah. For real.
Dialogue: 55,0:23:02.99,0:23:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't admit that to them!
Dialogue: 55,0:23:06.32,0:23:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But even if you realize that now,
Dialogue: 55,0:23:09.33,0:23:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,you have neither time\Nnor a chance of winning!
Dialogue: 55,0:23:11.95,0:23:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{30 more seconds at most! - OG}I'd say at most there's thirty seconds!
Dialogue: 55,0:23:14.12,0:23:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{After that, their hearts\Nwill completely stop! - OG}After that, their hearts\Nwill have stopped completely!
Dialogue: 55,0:23:17.33,0:23:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{As we speak, they're probably writhing in pain with what little consciousness they have left - OG}Darkness now closes in on them,\Ntheir bodies wracked with pain,
Dialogue: 55,0:23:22.05,0:23:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,as they experience the terror of dying!
Dialogue: 55,0:23:28.18,0:23:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't need thirty seconds!\NI'll save them {\i1}now{\i0}!
Dialogue: 55,0:23:30.56,0:23:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}Lethal Fire–
Dialogue: 55,0:23:32.02,0:23:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Breeze Breath Bomb!
Dialogue: 55,0:23:37.85,0:23:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 55,0:23:44.03,0:23:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you not hear him say\Nyou have no chance of winning?
Dialogue: 55,0:23:51.33,0:23:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit! There's no time!
Dialogue: 55,0:23:54.62,0:23:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{Give it up! - OG}Just give up!
Dialogue: 55,0:24:03.05,0:24:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen...
Dialogue: 55,0:24:04.05,0:24:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this rope...
Dialogue: 55,0:24:05.59,0:24:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? This looks like fun!
Dialogue: 55,0:24:08.51,0:24:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatcha planning?
Dialogue: 55,0:24:10.43,0:24:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I join in, too?
Dialogue: 55,0:24:15.73,0:24:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Karoo.
Dialogue: 55,0:24:16.85,0:24:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Run.
Dialogue: 55,0:24:18.35,0:24:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 55,0:24:20.19,0:24:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{Just run around all the candlesticks! - OG}Just keep running around\Nall the candles!
Dialogue: 55,0:24:26.28,0:24:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{Everything you try is pointless! - OG}It's pointless! Give up!
Dialogue: 55,0:24:28.91,0:24:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{Pardon me. - OG}'Scuse me.
Dialogue: 55,0:24:31.32,0:24:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Crescendo Stone!
Dialogue: 55,0:24:35.08,0:24:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{How many kilograms\Ncan you endure, I wonder... - OG}Let's see how many kilograms\Nit'll take until you break!{Z}
Dialogue: 55,0:24:40.83,0:24:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}10 kilograms!
Dialogue: 55,0:24:44.05,0:24:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}100 kilograms!
Dialogue: 55,0:24:48.13,0:24:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}200 kilograms!
Dialogue: 55,0:24:51.76,0:24:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}300 kilograms!
Dialogue: 55,0:24:57.10,0:25:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn nimble bird!
Dialogue: 55,0:25:01.69,0:25:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it up! Give it up!{Ya yo, ya yo!}
Dialogue: 55,0:25:04.40,0:25:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{They've become my works of art! - OG}They've already become\Nmy masterful works of art!
Dialogue: 55,0:25:09.86,0:25:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so!
Dialogue: 55,0:25:11.45,0:25:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{I won't let you have their lives! - OG}I won't lose them\Nto a weirdo like you!
Dialogue: 55,0:25:14.87,0:25:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{If fire can melt them,\Nthen I'll use this fire! - OG}If fire can melt them,\Nthen I'll just use this thing here!{Z}
Dialogue: 55,0:25:19.16,0:25:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't pull! Stop!
Dialogue: 55,0:25:20.87,0:25:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{Luffy! That small flame\Nwon't do it fast enough! - OG}Luffy! That small flame\Nwon't work fast enough!
Dialogue: 55,0:25:25.09,0:25:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Light Karoo's rope on fire!
Dialogue: 55,0:25:28.30,0:25:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The bird's rope?!
Dialogue: 55,0:25:30.13,0:25:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a special rope...
Dialogue: 55,0:25:31.63,0:25:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 55,0:25:32.51,0:25:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,...soaked in oil!
Dialogue: 55,0:25:35.22,0:25:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay! Everyone! Wake up!
Dialogue: 55,0:25:36.01,0:25:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Wait! Stop!
Dialogue: 55,0:25:38.39,0:25:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{It'll be a little hot, but endure it...  - OG}Things are gonna heat up,\Nbut bear with it.
Dialogue: 55,0:25:41.73,0:25:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 55,0:25:44.15,0:25:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow! Hot!
Dialogue: 55,0:25:56.91,0:26:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeow! Hot! Hot!
Dialogue: 55,0:26:01.71,0:26:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{What a big fire!\NAre they gonna be alright?! - OG}That fire's huge!
Dialogue: 55,0:26:03.50,0:26:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{What a big fire!\NAre they gonna be alright?! - OG}Are they gonna be okay?!
Dialogue: 55,0:26:05.88,0:26:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{Curse you... Curse you, Straw Hat! - OG}You've done it now, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 55,0:26:09.55,0:26:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{How dare you destroy my Candle Service Set! - OG}How dare you lay waste\Nto my candle service set!
Dialogue: 55,0:26:13.93,0:26:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{You'll pay for this! - OG}You'll rue the day!
Dialogue: 55,0:26:20.10,0:26:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{I won't let you get away, you jerks! - OG}Get back here, you jerks!
Dialogue: 55,0:26:25.44,0:26:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{Damn it! How dare you mock us! - OG}Dammit!
Dialogue: 55,0:26:26.94,0:26:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{Damn it! How dare you mock us! - OG}Take us seriously!
Dialogue: 55,0:26:30.61,0:26:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{Now you've done it! - OG}Now you guys have done it!
Dialogue: 55,0:26:34.91,0:26:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Playtime is over!
Dialogue: 55,0:26:37.66,0:26:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{I'm going to shatter that\Nneck of yours into pieces! - OG}I'm gonna shatter your neck...\Ninto itty bitty pieces!
Dialogue: 55,0:26:41.79,0:26:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Lethal...
Dialogue: 55,0:26:42.75,0:26:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}10,000 Kilo Guillotine!
Dialogue: 55,0:26:55.14,0:26:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{That was hot! Couldn't you\Nhave done it a different way? - OG}Was using that much heat\Nreally necessary?
Dialogue: 55,0:27:02.35,0:27:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{Don't be fussy!\NJust be thankful you were saved! - OG}Complaining already?
Dialogue: 55,0:27:04.10,0:27:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{Don't be fussy!\NJust be thankful you were saved! - OG}Show a little gratitude\Ntoward your savior!
Dialogue: 55,0:27:06.94,0:27:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right. Thanks!
Dialogue: 55,0:27:08.82,0:27:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,This doesn't seem real!
Dialogue: 55,0:27:10.19,0:27:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We're alive!
Dialogue: 55,0:27:11.78,0:27:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{The wax melted. - OG}So the wax melted...
Dialogue: 55,0:27:13.78,0:27:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pain!
Dialogue: 55,0:27:16.03,0:27:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{We can't afford to screw up our mission any further! - OG}We can't afford\Nto blow another mission!
Dialogue: 55,0:27:20.74,0:27:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. 5!
Dialogue: 55,0:27:22.70,0:27:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Lethal Exploding Star!
Dialogue: 55,0:27:26.58,0:27:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{Fool! - OG}Are you stupid?!
Dialogue: 55,0:27:27.58,0:27:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{I've shown several times that explosives don't work on me! I'm an "explosive man"! - OG}I'm a human bomb! You've seen\Nthat explosives don't work on me!
Dialogue: 55,0:27:32.55,0:27:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You took the bait!
Dialogue: 55,0:27:36.18,0:27:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{So sorry for you! I'm a liar, you see! - OG}Too bad for you! I'm a liar, you see!
Dialogue: 55,0:27:39.18,0:27:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That wasn't an exploding star!\NIt was a special tabasco star!{Z- Tabasco is a brand name and should be capitalized, however there's also a tabasco pepper, so the botanical variety would get lowercased. We can make the argument that Usopp makes the tabasco stars out of the peppers}
Dialogue: 55,0:27:43.68,0:27:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Spicy!
Dialogue: 55,0:27:50.19,0:27:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{I already proved its effectiveness the hard way! - OG}I already checked\Nits effectiveness the hard way!
Dialogue: 55,0:27:54.99,0:27:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{Damn you pirates! - OG}You lousy pirates!
Dialogue: 55,0:27:58.99,0:28:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{Time to blow up in a full-body explosion! - OG}I'll blow you away\Nwith a full-body explosion!
Dialogue: 55,0:28:01.28,0:28:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There won't even be bone fragments left!
Dialogue: 55,0:28:04.29,0:28:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Stop!
Dialogue: 55,0:28:06.79,0:28:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 55,0:28:08.37,0:28:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\t(2194,0,1,\c&H0A0805&\3c&H0A0805&\4c&H0A0805&)}{No! I'm sorry! I won't do it anymore! - OG}No! I'm sorry! It won't happen again!
Dialogue: 55,0:28:18.26,0:28:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Flaming Oni...
Dialogue: 55,0:28:23.39,0:28:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Giri!
Dialogue: 55,0:28:41.41,0:28:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{Flaming swords aren't too shabby. - OG}Fiery blades. Not too shabby.
Dialogue: 55,0:28:48.00,0:28:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 55,0:29:00.89,0:29:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{Yo. Good to see you're alive. - OG}Hey, good to see you're alive.{Z}
Dialogue: 55,0:29:04.39,0:29:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 55,0:29:13.40,0:29:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Master...
Dialogue: 55,0:29:16.57,0:29:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{That leaves two foes left. - OG}That leaves two foes remaining.
Dialogue: 55,0:29:21.86,0:29:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Bird!
Dialogue: 55,0:29:24.49,0:29:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{Don't let them get away with this! - OG}They won't get off so easy!
Dialogue: 55,0:29:27.50,0:29:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Real men don't spoil people's fights!
Dialogue: 55,0:29:37.80,0:29:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,How good of you to come!
Dialogue: 55,0:29:39.84,0:29:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to my Wax-Wax Mansion!
Dialogue: 55,0:29:43.34,0:29:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?!
Dialogue: 55,0:29:45.26,0:29:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{Well, then.\NCan you tell where I am? - OG}Well, then. Can you\Npick out the real me?
Dialogue: 55,0:29:53.81,0:29:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{It would appear you picked a fight\Nwith the wrong people! - OG}It seems you picked a fight\Nwith the wrong people!
Dialogue: 55,0:29:58.03,0:30:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{We're the most intellectual\Nteam in all of Baroque Works! - OG}Our team's intellect is unparalleled\Nin all of Baroque Works!
Dialogue: 55,0:30:03.07,0:30:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{A brute force buffoon like you who\Nacts on instinct cannot catch us! - OG}{\q2}A brute like you, acting on instinct alone,\Nhas no hope against us!
Dialogue: 55,0:30:12.00,0:30:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Mr. 3.
Dialogue: 55,0:30:14.63,0:30:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{I carry out all assignments given to me flawlessly. - OG}I flawlessly execute any mission\Nto which I am assigned.
Dialogue: 55,0:30:18.50,0:30:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{Now, then! Step forward! - OG}Now, then! Step inside!
Dialogue: 55,0:30:28.43,0:30:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{The moment your back is\Nturned to me, I'll stab you... - OG}But the moment you turn your back\Nto me, you'll get a dagger...
Dialogue: 55,0:30:38.98,0:30:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,right through the heart.
Dialogue: 55,0:30:50.04,0:30:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 55,0:30:52.25,0:30:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Stamp!
Dialogue: 55,0:30:58.34,0:31:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,How...
Dialogue: 55,0:31:00.38,0:31:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,did you know...
Dialogue: 55,0:31:03.80,0:31:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I was here?
Dialogue: 55,0:31:12.64,0:31:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{A hunch. - OG}Instinct.{Z- to play off Mr. 3's line at 30:54}
Dialogue: 55,0:31:45.97,0:31:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{Hold on, now! - OG}Hey, wait a minute!
Dialogue: 55,0:31:48.09,0:31:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{This is no time for me to be\Ndrinking tea all fancy like! - OG}This is no time for me to be\Nsipping tea all fancy like!
Dialogue: 55,0:31:52.93,0:31:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{Nami-san and the others might be waiting for me to help them! - OG}Nami and the others might be\Nwaiting for me to save them!
Dialogue: 55,0:31:58.23,0:32:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, though.
Dialogue: 55,0:32:00.65,0:32:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{What's such a\Nrelaxing place doing in the jungle? - OG}Why's a relaxing place like this\Nin the middle of a jungle?
Dialogue: 55,0:32:16.04,0:32:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 55,0:32:26.67,0:32:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a transponder snail.
Dialogue: 55,0:32:31.97,0:32:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{Heya, you've called Damn Restaurant. - OG}{Heya, you've reached\N[/i1]Restaurant de Merde[/i0]. - Gaijin}Hey there!{Z- used as a Flashback in Alabasta 05 @21:14 and referenced in Alabasta 08 @27:39}
Dialogue: 55,0:32:34.14,0:32:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{Heya, you've called Damn Restaurant. - OG}{Heya, you've reached\N[/i1]Restaurant de Merde[/i0]. - Gaijin}You've reached The Shit Shack.{Z- used as a Flashback in Alabasta 05 @21:14 and referenced in Alabasta 08 @27:39}
Dialogue: 55,0:32:36.27,0:32:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{You want reservations? - OG}Making a reservation?
Dialogue: 55,0:32:41.48,0:32:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{Quit fooling around, dumbass. - OG}Quit fooling around,
Dialogue: 55,0:32:43.44,0:32:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{Quit fooling around, dumbass. - OG}you idiot.
Dialogue: 55,0:32:47.40,0:32:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Aren't you a bit late\Nwith your report?{\i0}
Dialogue: 55,0:32:51.82,0:32:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Report?
Dialogue: 55,0:32:55.62,0:32:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And who might I be talking to?
Dialogue: 55,0:32:59.17,0:33:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 55,0:33:00.42,0:33:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mr. 0.{\i0}
